 are complex, especially considering the different approaches to public health and criminal justice. Many people are concerned about the impact on different age groups and the overall safety of the population. It's a difficult issue to eat over, and requires careful consideration of various factors. The nuances of the law can be challenging to understand, even for those familiar with legal terminology. It’s important to consider how these shifts might influence everyday activities, such as shopping or even the way people communicate, their tongue becoming more cautious.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "Oregon", "logprob": -0.003800314385443926}, {"token": "’", "logprob": -2.0765695571899414}, {"token": "s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁trial", "logprob": -0.70609450340271}, {"token": "▁period", "logprob": -0.5350235104560852}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.10366643965244293}, {"token": "▁decriminal", "logprob": -0.00648785475641489}, {"token": "izing", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": "▁drugs", "logprob": -0.1768297702074051}, {"token": "▁ends", "logprob": -0.2548803985118866}, {"token": "▁this", "logprob": -2.351412534713745}, {"token": "▁Sunday", "logprob": -0.0012406755704432726}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.20293103158473969}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.00515738083049655}, {"token": "▁new", "logprob": -0.01762455143034458}, {"token": "▁law", "logprob": -0.004934750963002443}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.012230283580720425}, {"token": "▁HB", "logprob": -7.199982064776123e-05}, {"token": "4", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "0", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "0", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.6927575416048057e-05}, {"token": "▁will", "logprob": -0.08095653355121613}, {"token": "▁reinstate", "logprob": -0.0038386720698326826}, {"token": "▁criminal", "logprob": -5.006777428206988e-06}, {"token": "▁penalties", "logprob": -0.11326386779546738}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -4.482168878894299e-05}, {"token": 